    "sections": {
        "description": "Window Cleaning is designed for cleaning service providers, maintenance companies, and related businesses. It includes structured sections for displaying services, testimonials, galleries, and contact information. The layout allows businesses to present service details such as cleaning, maintenance, and related offerings in a clear and organized format. The theme provides customizable homepage sections, color options, and layout settings through the WordPress Customizer. It supports commonly used plugins and includes space for service listings, image galleries, blog posts, and contact forms. The design is responsive and adapts to mobile, tablet, and desktop devices. Window Cleaning is suitable for service-based businesses seeking a simple and structured website layout."
